WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:05.693
- Hello.

00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:06.860
- Hey.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.520
I have to go grab Madison
real quick because she forgot

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.594
her pass, so I'll be right
back, but sit, please.

00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:13.427
- Okay.

00:00:15.973 --> 00:00:19.820
Ooh, brownies, oh my
god, they look so good.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.409
- And I was like, "That's
not what it means at all."

00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:23.278
- Oh, I know.
- Yeah.

00:00:23.278 --> 00:00:24.945
- These are so good.

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:29.107
- Wow, someone must need
to relieve a lot of stress.

00:00:29.107 --> 00:00:33.360
- Yeah, well brownies are
like my favorite thing ever.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.932
- Oh no.

00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:35.765
Oh, okay.

00:00:38.422 --> 00:00:41.422
Bridget, those are special brownies.

00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:46.920
- How many have you had?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.224
(uncertainly grunts)

00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:51.057
They're weed brownies.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:56.184
(upbeat music)

00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:01.034
- Oh shit, oh shit, oh
shit, oh shit, oh shit.

00:01:01.034 --> 00:01:02.289
- No, no no no, don't even worry about it,

00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:03.988
it's gonna be totally fine.

00:01:03.988 --> 00:01:04.917
- Yeah, you know what, it probably

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:06.373
didn't even affect you that much.

00:01:06.373 --> 00:01:07.561
I'm gonna have one too!

00:01:07.561 --> 00:01:08.588
- Yeah.
- But you know, I'm only

00:01:08.588 --> 00:01:10.037
gonna have half because we
made these really strong.

00:01:10.037 --> 00:01:10.998
- Yeah.

00:01:10.998 --> 00:01:13.315
I'll have half too though,
okay, this is gonna be fun.

00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:14.148
- Yeah.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.387
- Yeah, you're right, it's gonna be fine.

00:01:20.983 --> 00:01:22.316
Is this my face?

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:26.862
(whimsical music)

00:01:26.862 --> 00:01:28.945
- Hey where'd Madison go?

00:01:30.449 --> 00:01:32.616
- I have a face.
- Madison?

00:01:35.182 --> 00:01:37.682
- You have a nice face.
- I do?

00:01:41.925 --> 00:01:44.592
(ominous music)

00:01:46.087 --> 00:01:47.754
- They're listening.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:52.445
- I'm hungry, you wanna get some food?

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.542
- I can't swallow, how do you swallow?

00:01:55.542 --> 00:01:56.829
What if I suffocate?

00:01:56.829 --> 00:01:58.618
- No, you gotta stay alive
for the chicken tenders,

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.754
they are so good.

00:02:00.754 --> 00:02:03.055
- I can't feel my arms,
do I still have arms?

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.888
- Yes.
- I want my mum!

00:02:06.146 --> 00:02:10.313
Just so beautiful, look
at its patterns, its form.

00:02:15.641 --> 00:02:18.808
- You should probably have some water.

00:02:22.331 --> 00:02:23.998
- Oh.
- [Woman] Oops.

00:02:25.055 --> 00:02:27.138
(laughs)

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.673
- Okay, but it's not like that funny,

00:02:31.673 --> 00:02:34.014
okay it's kinda funny, yeah.

00:02:34.014 --> 00:02:36.097
(laughs)

00:02:46.326 --> 00:02:49.215
(upbeat music)

00:02:49.215 --> 00:02:51.177
- I need ranch.

00:02:51.177 --> 00:02:53.448
Are you gonna be okay?

00:02:53.448 --> 00:02:54.281
Okay.

00:02:55.489 --> 00:02:57.516
They only had bleu
cheese, which is insane.

00:02:57.516 --> 00:02:58.349
Oh my god.

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:03.388
That's gonna come back to haunt you later.

00:03:03.388 --> 00:03:05.680
- Why are we even on this planet?

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:09.274
- Well Bridget, I'm glad
you brought this up.

00:03:09.274 --> 00:03:10.653
See, I've been thinking about this a lot

00:03:10.653 --> 00:03:13.172
and I feel like the
universe is like an aquarium

00:03:13.172 --> 00:03:15.846
and we are all the killer whales.

00:03:15.846 --> 00:03:17.895
So I should probably
road trip across America

00:03:17.895 --> 00:03:21.565
because that's what makes
the most sense in this world.

00:03:21.565 --> 00:03:25.574
Sorry, I'm rambling a
lot, I just really like

00:03:25.574 --> 00:03:29.741
talking to you Bridget, in
fact I think that I like you

00:03:32.108 --> 00:03:35.290
more than a friend and I'm sorry if

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.790
that's weird but that' just how I... feel.

00:03:40.056 --> 00:03:42.298
Well that's probably for the best.

00:03:42.298 --> 00:03:46.465
Bridget, Bridget, come one,
let's get you home, let's go.

00:03:49.286 --> 00:03:52.786
(gentle orchestral music)

00:03:55.287 --> 00:03:56.367
(gasps)

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:57.750
Where have you been?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.609
(laughs)

00:03:58.609 --> 00:03:59.556
- I went to get ice cream.

